            QuizQuestion("When computing aggregate features, you should:", ["Compute on the entire dataset", "Compute on training data only, then apply to test", "Compute after model training", "Skip aggregation entirely"], 1, "Compute aggregations on training data only to prevent leakage. Apply the same aggregation to test data."),
