            QuizQuestion("The most important principle in feature engineering is:", ["Create as many features as possible", "Measure the impact of each feature on model performance", "Only use automated feature engineering", "Focus on algorithm tuning instead"], 1, "Always measure whether your engineered features actually improve performance — don't create features blindly."),
